00:44:34,920 --> 00:44:35,790
Polisi!

561
00:44:35,880 --> 00:44:37,540
Dengarlah kami"

562
00:44:37,630 --> 00:44:39,040
Polisi!

563
00:44:39,130 --> 00:44:44,330
Dengarlah kami"

564
