601
00:48:45,210 --> 00:48:46,040
Apa?

602
00:48:46,920 --> 00:48:48,380
Beri aku satu kesempatan terakhir.

603
00:48:48,460 --> 00:48:51,040
Ini kesempatan emas, Nyonya Martin. Kau akan...

604
00:48:51,130 --> 00:48:52,210
"Panggilan dari nomor tak dikenal"

605
00:48:52,290 --> 00:48:53,170
Halo?

606
00:48:54,290 --> 00:48:55,130
Halo?

607
00:48:56,830 --> 00:48:58,170
Ayo.

608
00:49:01,080 --> 00:49:01,920
Halo?

609
